{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6b84be3ab91ab77f6252187daea6f837e156afb65f40e061320760c5ed51fdd5", "ja": "それは……もしかして、絆創膏か？", "zh": "那是……难道说，是创可贴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "b3715dae5167764011c461f907c8678f3555e775111ca1aa2870613c1b94b274", "ja": "そう！　ピンク色の絆創膏！\nすっごくカワイイでしょ？", "zh": "对！粉色的创可贴！\n特别可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b28b8569c9ffcbac35a9612f98a60498d328ad2859408544a201c01fcaa6483", "ja": "この前ね、体育の授業でバスケがあったんだけど。\n同じチームの子が、転んですりむいちゃったんだ。", "zh": "前阵子体育课上打了篮球。\n和我同队的孩子摔倒擦伤了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "2763a0ed10af9f4dd1458c77f42a44947394a2e67a4cc95627807b57220025f7", "ja": "「大したことないから、保健室とかいいよ」って、\nそのまま授業受けようとしてて。", "zh": "她说着“没什么大不了的，不用去医务室啦”，\n就打算直接继续上课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "5be2a40feae295ab926e95c8550027482decc40957d695f2738a0a0cd3e5db8b", "ja": "そしたら別の友達が、絆創膏をスッて渡したの！\nそれ見て私、なんか感動しちゃったんだーっ！", "zh": "结果另一个朋友“唰”地递给了她一张创可贴！\n看到这一幕，我不知怎么的就感动了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1010_p", "source_sha256": "79495f8ec5cf1083d80feaebd2058ca82b8b913d5170ac62c4d75530b20cc94c", "ja": "なるほど。それで、絆創膏を持ってるのか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，你才会随身带着创可贴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "f8c5b52741d0631a25ad5a7dacd645c9572ab53f7d075a05df30ad571c606586", "ja": "うん！　その子を見習って、持ち歩くようにしたの！\nいつか困ってる人がいたら、渡せたらいいなーって。", "zh": "嗯！我就是向那孩子学习，也开始随身带着了！\n想着要是哪天遇到有困难的人，能把它交给对方就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "876391dfa77ecd5f8ed546b03d64ddd8a5534bb9c5dd2feb6881803c3a391148", "ja": "でも、まだ誰にも渡したことないんだけどね！\n誰もケガしない方がいいから、いいんだけど☆", "zh": "不过，我还没给过任何人就是了！\n毕竟还是没人受伤比较好，这样也挺好的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c54a81c051660cf1013c4784f2a71ccc0ef7fb7ee7026436b04c918350a79d59", "ja": "それなら、早速1枚もらっていいか？\n書類で指を切ったみたいなんだ。", "zh": "既然这样，那我现在就拿1张，可以吗？好像被文件划伤手指了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce8e7b18a7dc5203078b44536f70cae9b944e4263b9c13fedffb42536d09fef0", "ja": "えーっ！？\n{$P$}、大丈夫っ！？", "zh": "诶——！？\n{$P$}，没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2d4971a4443af4054b1617fb860a461b16d6c39bc3dd522882a9c29cd6a1d997", "ja": "そうだな、これからは気をつけるよ。\nで、もらって大丈夫か？", "zh": "那好，今后我会注意的。话说，我收下没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "a20612d126aa119fd88783c2c36feeed9097b746a90be2c047d3ba57d8c2ec62", "ja": "もちろん！　じゃあ{$P$}には、\n私のお気に入りのやつあげるね！", "zh": "当然！那我就把我自己最喜欢的那个，\n送给{$P$}吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "b66c5f5f8d3118195f83c797adc5d75e1620ed5f6b250836fc8cadb39e315862", "ja": "はい、どうぞっ！\nえへへ、どう？　すっごくカワイイでしょ？", "zh": "来，给你！\n嘿嘿，怎么样？是不是特别可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ec9a844dad1e020a68c3e82792f06736b17a5c268f95dd3f8360157428bf7764", "ja": "これは……バレエ柄？　チュチュに、トゥシューズか。\nはは、かわいいな。ありがとう海美、助かったよ！", "zh": "这是……芭蕾图案？有芭蕾舞裙，还有足尖鞋啊。\n哈哈，真可爱。谢谢你，海美，帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0183_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "39761e7692e5707a176bfb6f5f40c2c12a5e69e23850d0f3b3014f550926b555", "ja": "うんっ！　あ、でもケガはしないほうがいいんだよ？\n気をつけてね、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！啊，不过还是不要受伤比较好哦？\n要小心啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
